Last working version: 3.4.23
Possibly related:
https://github.com/vuejs/core/commit/5cef52a5c23ba8ba3239e6def03b8ff008d3cc72#diff-8d5ec7c83895d7e238b2db7d7ac5dca5470cfdde52e432d693c390cc52978d15R1643
https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/11132

Was broken in 3.4.24, since 3.4.27 works fine with the code below
